    {
      "source": "<a href=\"IndexDefinitionProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinitionProvider</code></a> that allows registering new <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a> via\n<a href=\"IndexDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinitionRegistry</code></a>.",
      "translation": "允许通过 <a href=\"IndexDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexDefinitionRegistry</code></a> 注册新的 <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a> 的 <a href=\"IndexDefinitionProvider.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexDefinitionProvider</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"SpelIndexDefinition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.index\"><code>SpelIndexDefinition</code></a> defines index that is evaluated based on a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> requires the\n<a href=\"../convert/SpelIndexResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>SpelIndexResolver</code></a> to be evaluated.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"SpelIndexDefinition.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.redis.core.index 中的类\"><code>SpelIndexDefinition</code></a> 定义了一个索引，该索引基于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.expression.spel.standard 中的类或接口\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> 进行评估，需要 <a href=\"../convert/SpelIndexResolver.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert 中的类\"><code>SpelIndexResolver</code></a> 来进行评估。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"IndexDefinitionProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinitionProvider</code></a> give access to <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s for creating secondary index structures.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"IndexDefinitionProvider.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexDefinitionProvider</code></a> 提供对 <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a> 的访问，用于创建二级索引结构。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"IndexConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.index\"><code>IndexConfiguration</code></a> allows programmatic setup of indexes.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"IndexConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.index 中的类\"><code>IndexConfiguration</code></a> 允许通过编程方式配置索引。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a> allow to set up a blueprint for creating secondary index structures in Redis.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.index 中的接口\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a> 允许设置创建 Redis 中二级索引结构的蓝图。",
      "count": 1
